  "details": "I had this situation happen to me recently.\nMultiple friends of mine joined a friends only lobby which was created by someone who was not on my friends list (this made it appear as private for me). I sent 2 of them an invite request, which was not visible at all to them. I was only made aware that it was not an Invite[+] only instance when I got in contact with one of them \"after the fact\".\nI think in this situation my friends should see the same type of notification which is visible to you when getting an invite request to an invite only world where you are not the master.",
